{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>By the sweat of your brow.</b> It is found in the book of Rabbi Yehudah the Hasid that this curse is not fulfilled except upon those who work the land, and not upon kings and princes. But 'בעצב תלדי בנים' is fulfilled upon all women. And because the woman sinned and caused others to sin, therefore her curse is greater."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:59.568897580Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}